It is late.
I make a cup of tea and turn off the main light.
The apartment is very quiet now.
I take my tea with me into the bedroom.
Now I lie down in bed under the warm duvet.
I open my book and read.
For half an hour, I read.
My eyes become heavy.
I put the book on the nightstand.
Finally, I turn off the reading lamp.
My new routine is in place.
I close my eyes and sleep peacefully.
